1.2 Authorized Users: Refers to individuals or legal entities that have completed paid purchases through official channels and obtained formal written or system authorization from the copyright owner. Any entity without payment and official authorization possesses no right to use the Software.
1.3 Closed-Source Definition: The Software is a fully closed-source commercial product. No source code, core configuration files, underlying logic documents or core technical materials shall be disclosed to the public. The Software is not an open-source product, and any form of open-source dissemination is strictly prohibited.
