5. User Obligations
5.1 Users shall properly keep their authorization information and private keys, and shall not disclose or share authorization credentials. Users shall bear full responsibility for any infringement risks caused by improper custody.
5.2 Users shall not use the Software for illegal activities, infringement behaviors or network security violations. Otherwise, the copyright owner has the right to terminate the authorization, disable the Software access and pursue corresponding legal liabilities.
5.3 Users shall not delete, tamper with or shield the built-in copyright statements, authorization marks and watermarks of the Software.
