6.1 The Software is provided on an "AS IS" basis. The copyright owner does not warrant that the Software is completely defect-free or fault-free, but guarantees the normal operation of core functions under legitimate and compliant use.
6.2 The copyright owner shall not be liable for any software abnormalities, data loss or business losses caused by users’ unauthorized modification, cracking, improper operation, hardware failure, network exceptions or third-party tool interference.
6.3 Any legal disputes, civil compensations or administrative penalties arising from unauthorized cracking, tampering or distribution shall be borne solely by the infringing party, and the copyright owner shall not be held responsible.
7. Liability and Infringement Pursuit
7.1 For any violation of this Agreement or intellectual property infringement of the Software, the copyright owner has the right to terminate the user’s authorization immediately, take technical protection measures such as account and device banning, and pursue civil liabilities and full economic compensation from the infringer.
